usage: check-registry-coverage.py [-h] (--revision REV | --selftest)
                                  [--branch BRANCH] [--baseline-tools REV]
                                  [--audit-live-map]

Check the operative SKILL.md registry against committed tools/.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --revision REV        7-64 hex commit landed on the selected branch
  --selftest            hermetic fixture suite
  --branch BRANCH       landed branch (default master)
  --baseline-tools REV  compare the inspected tool set with this landed
                        revision
  --audit-live-map      also enforce the finite boot-chain-audit schema-v2
                        mode map
